WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.362
Excuse me! I'm looking for the City Museum. Can you help me?

2
00:00:04.812 --> 00:00:07.180
Sure! It's not far.

3
00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:10.209
Is the museum near here?

4
00:00:10.659 --> 00:00:15.953
Yes, it's a ten-minute walk. First, go straight on Main Street.

5
00:00:18.203 --> 00:00:20.897
At the traffic light, turn left.

6
00:00:21.347 --> 00:00:24.272
At the traffic light, turn left. OK!

7
00:00:26.522 --> 00:00:29.820
Then walk two blocks and go past the bank.

8
00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.452
Two blocks… past the bank.

9
00:00:34.702 --> 00:00:36.142
Go over the bridge.

10
00:00:37.192 --> 00:00:39.793
At the roundabout, turn right.

11
00:00:40.243 --> 00:00:42.657
Turn right at the roundabout. Got it!

12
00:00:44.907 --> 00:00:48.390
The museum is at the corner, next to the church.

13
00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.280
Thank you very much!

14
00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:52.170
You're welcome!

15
00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.392
And you? Is there a museum near your house?

